            "id": "751f1a8f-9f6b-33a6-8ee4-840523b8897f",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Nvidia taps TSMC for more H200 chips due to China demand: Reuters",
            "description": "<p>Yahoo Finance Markets and Data Editor <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/jared-blikre/\">Jared Blikre</a> tracks Wednesday's <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/trending/\">top moving stocks</a> and biggest market stories in this<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-minute/\"> Market Minute</a>.</p>\n<p>Mortgage rates were at their lowest level of 2025 through Tuesday, with the 30-year rate at 6.15%, according to data from Freddie Mac (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/FMCC\">FMCC</a>).</p>\n<p>Nvidia (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NVDA\">NVDA</a>) has reportedly asked Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing Company (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/TSM\">TSM</a>) to ramp up production of its H200 artificial intelligence (AI) to meet high demand, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.reuters.com/world/china/nvidia-sounds-out-tsmc-new-h200-chip-order-china-demand-jumps-sources-say-2025-12-31/\">according to Reuters</a>.</p>\n<p>Stay up to date on the latest market action, minute-by-minute, with <a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-minute/\">Yahoo Finance's Market Minute.</a></p>",
            "summary": "Yahoo Finance Markets and Data Editor Jared Blikre tracks Wednesday's top moving stocks and biggest market stories in this Market Minute. Mortgage rates were at their lowest level of 2025 through Tuesday, with the 30-year rate at 6.15%, according to data from Freddie Mac (FMCC). Nvidia (NVDA) has reportedly asked Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing Company (TSM) to ramp up production of its H200 artificial intelligence (AI) to meet high demand, according to Reuters. Stay up to date on the latest market action, minute-by-minute, with Yahoo Finance's Market Minute.",
